at reset:
  pc = 0x0
  priv = 0x3
  mstatus = 0x1800
  mip = 0x0
  mie = 0x0
  mcause = 0x0
in the interrupt handler, before it reads the character:
  mip = 0x800
  mie = 0x800
  mcause = 0x8000000b
  mstatus = 0x1880
  priv = 0x3
  the pc is the handler's address: 0x1
  mepc is in main: 0x1
  x/xw 0xffff0004 (RCR)        0x00000003
after the handler has read the character, and one more instruction:
  mip = 0x0
  x/xw 0xffff0004 (RCR)        0x00000002
  a0 (the character)           0x61
